; Regression test for GitHub issue #3314: under --permissive, a balance
; assignment that leaves the balanced virtual postings, in [brackets],
; unbalanced gives way to the amount that balances them, just as one
; among real postings does (#2005).

2021/02/14 Test transaction
  [Liabilities:Visa]  $3141
  [Assets:Checking]  =$12345

test bal --permissive
              $-3141  Assets:Checking
               $3141  Liabilities:Visa
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 8:
While balancing transaction from "$FILE", lines 6-8:
> 2021/02/14 Test transaction
>   [Liabilities:Visa]  $3141
>   [Assets:Checking]  =$12345
Unbalanced remainder of balanced virtual postings is:
              $15486
Amount to balance against:
              $15486
Error: Transaction does not balance
end test
